  This server reads and writes OpenToonz's documented-by-source file formats (.tnz scenes,
  .pli vector levels) and drives the installed OpenToonz.exe and tcomposer.exe. The format
  knowledge was derived by reading the OpenToonz v1.8.0 source code and was checked
  against OpenToonz's own renderer.

Third-party Python packages used at runtime (installed separately, under their own licenses):
  mcp (MIT), Pillow (MIT-CMU), Shapely (BSD-3-Clause), fontTools (MIT), svgelements (MIT).
